v style=\"font-size:0.78125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.4rem\">Integrated Telematics &amp; Safety Systems</div><ul style=\"list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0.4rem\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Sliding Winch Tracks &amp; Heavy-Duty Strap Tie-Downs</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Heavy-Duty Aluminum Ramps stored under deck</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>GPS Trailer Asset Tracking</span></li></ul></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:0.85rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Ideal for: <strong>Over-Height Structural Steel • Building Materials &amp; Pipe Loads • Commercial Machinery</strong></div><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:0.55rem 1.15rem;font-size:0.85rem\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Check Equipment Availability</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_footerGrid__Zjk4v\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background-color:var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.02em;display:block\">GETDIGIFORT</span><span style=\"font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase\">DMB TRANSIT INC.</span></div></div><p class=\"Footer_brandDesc__JyP2_\">GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.<!-- --> Asset-based transportation, GDP cold chain, and high-volume FTL freight solutions across North America.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:#CBD5E1\"><strong>Operational Credentials:</strong> <!-- -->USDOT 3849120<!-- --> | <!-- -->MC-892104<!-- --> | SCAC: <!-- -->DMBT</div><div class=\"Footer_certList__YOlHk\"><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">ISO 9001:2015 Certified</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">EPA SmartWay Transport Partner</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">TIA Certified Transportation Broker</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">C-TPAT Tier 2 Validated Carrier</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">GDP Compliant Cold Chain Carrier</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Freight Services</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/services/full-truckload-ftl\">Full Truckload (FTL)</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/temperature-controlled-cold-chain\">Refrigerated Cold Chain</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/heavy-haul-specialized\">Heavy Haul &amp; Over-Dimensional</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/intermodal-rail-freight\">Intermodal Rail Freight</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/warehousing-contract-logistics\">Contract Warehousing</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/expedited-critical-freight\">Expedited &amp; Hot-Shot Freight</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Company &amp; Insights</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/about\">About GetDigiFort</a></li><li><a href=\"/fleet\">Fleet Specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"/industries\">Industries Served</a></li><li><a href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog\">Logistics Blog</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Terminal Network</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"Footer_contactCol__dVXsM\"><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Dispatch Command</h4><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><strong>Headquarters:</strong><br/>4500 DigiFort Logistics Way, Suite 800<br/>Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->IL<!-- --> <!-- -->60666</div></div><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><div><strong>24/7 Digital Dispatch:</strong><br/><a href=\"mailto:dispatch@getdigifort.com\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600\">dispatch@getdigifort.com</a></div></div><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><div><strong>Freight Rate Quotes:</strong><br/><a href=\"mailto:quotes@getdigifort.com\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">quotes@getdigifort.com</a></div></div><div class=\"Footer_newsletterBox___iFuE\"><div class=\"Footer_newsletterTitle__wDdpU\">Freight Market Intelligence</div><p class=\"Footer_newsletterDesc__HDsR1\">Subscribe to our quarterly supply chain briefings and rat